{"id":"00072","root":"uni00072_1","name":{"ja":"神村　舞華","en":"Kamimura Maika"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"神村　舞華","en":"Kamimura Maika"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-01-16","limited":true,"characterId":59,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。火遁の術を操る。火遁の術使いの中でも最高クラスの火炎を操る事が出来るが火炎が強力過ぎて制御が難しいために、ゆきかぜと同様、パワー制御のために特別に制作された携帯式火砲を使用している。彼女は“冥途バズーカ”と名付けた火砲の中に弾丸となる火球弾を発生させて発射、火球弾は着弾すると超高熱の爆炎が噴き上げ一瞬で魔を滅殺するという。ヤンキー娘。言葉使いは荒々しいが弱きを助け強きを挫く昔ながらの番長スタイル。硬派を気取っているが本当はギャルに憧れていて、誰も知る者のいない街で時おりギャルのファッションに身を包んで闊歩する事も。自宅の秘密の宝箱の中は可愛いもので溢れている。","en":"Kamimura Maika is a Taimanin who manipulates fire techniques. Among fire-tech users, she can control flames of the highest caliber, but the flames are so powerful that they're hard to contain, so, like Mizuki Yukikaze, she employs a specially crafted portable fire cannon for power control. She names the cannon \"Netherworld Bazooka\" and generates fireball projectiles inside it; when a fireball hits, it erupts in ultra-high-heat blast that incinerates demons in an instant. She's a yankee girl—her speech is rough, but she follows the classic boss-type code of helping the weak and crushing the strong. Though she pretends to be tough, she secretly admires gal culture and sometimes struts through the unnoticed streets dressed in gal fashion. Her secret chest at home overflows with cute items."},"illustrator":"Sian","voiceActor":"佐倉もも花","forms":[{"id":"uni00072_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[928,1856],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[129,258],"def":[135,270],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","90001"],"evolve":[["evo00010",5],["evo00011",15],["evo00012",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00072_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1356,2712],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[193,386],"def":[205,410],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","90001","90002"],"evolve":[["evo00011",10],["evo00012",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",